rs_it` — `nobody could check it` / `[a] accept` `[s] tell it` / `your call` / `?` (tui_e2e_test.go:255)\n- `a_refused_landing_is_incomplete` — `nobody could check it` / `[n] not right` (tui_e2e_test.go:307)\n- `a_refused_task_proposal_draws_no_schema_sentence` — `1 yes, set it up · 0 no · c change` (refusedargs_e2e_test.go:58)\n- `space_in_the_task_room_pages_the_card` — `enter open its room` / ` · waiting in this conversation · alt+a` then `new conversation` (tui_e2e_test.go:1928, :1960)\n\n## evidence\n\nTwo full runs (branch with unrelated session-economy fixes, and clean baseline) both fail the same five; twelve pass in both. This is the #184 class again — needles rotting against the surface. Filed from a public CI-reachable assertion; needs `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` or a profile key per liveKey.\n\n## acceptance\n\nThe five subtests pass on a clean `origin/dev` tree end to end, either because the needles track the surface again or because the surface is repaired.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1014/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":31275036095,"node_id":"MIE_lADOTu5AHM8AAAABRaozrc8AAAAHSCMtvw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/events/31275036095","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santos